---
// Tres estados según GET /whatsapp/connections: sin conectar, CONNECTED y FAILED.
// La lógica vive en services/view-integration.ts (whatsapp).
---

<section data-integration="whatsapp-connection" class="wa">
  <div class="wa-head">
    <span class="wa-icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">link</span>
    <div>
      <h2>Conexión de WhatsApp</h2>
      <p>Vincula un número de WhatsApp Business que ya exista en Meta.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p id="wa-loading" class="wa-muted" role="status">Consultando la conexión…</p>
  <p id="wa-simulated" class="wa-banner" role="status" hidden>
    Modo de prueba: esta conexión es simulada, no es real. No se envían mensajes de WhatsApp.
  </p>
  <p id="wa-plan-notice" class="wa-banner" role="status" hidden>
    Tu plan venció: renueva para vincular o cambiar el número. <a href="/billing">Renovar plan</a>
  </p>

  <div id="wa-connected" class="wa-connected" hidden>
    <div>
      <span class="wa-label">Número vinculado</span>
      <span id="wa-number" class="wa-number"></span>
    </div>
    <span class="wa-badge">Conectado</span>
    <button id="wa-change" type="button" class="wa-secondary">Cambiar número</button>
  </div>

  <p id="wa-failed" class="wa-alert" role="alert" hidden>
    No se pudo validar el número con Meta. Revisa los dos identificadores y vuelve a intentarlo.
  </p>

  <form id="whatsapp-link-form" class="wa-form" hidden novalidate>
    <p id="wa-replace-warning" class="wa-banner" hidden>
      Esto reemplaza el número actual. Si Meta no valida el nuevo, perderás la conexión que funciona hoy y el bot dejará de responder.
    </p>
    <ol class="wa-steps">
      <li>Abre tu app en Meta for Developers.</li>
      <li>Ve a <strong>WhatsApp → Configuración de la API</strong>.</li>
      <li>Copia el <strong>Phone number ID</strong> y el <strong>WhatsApp Business Account ID</strong>.</li>
    </ol>
    <label for="phone-number-id">Phone number ID</label>
    <input id="phone-number-id" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="123456789012345" maxlength="32" pattern="\d{1,32}" required aria-describedby="wa-format" />
    <label for="waba-id">WhatsApp Business Account ID (WABA)</label>
    <input id="waba-id" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="987654321098765" maxlength="32" pattern="\d{1,32}" required aria-describedby="wa-format" />
    <p id="wa-format" class="wa-muted">Solo números, sin espacios. La validación con Meta puede tardar hasta 10 segundos.</p>
    <div class="wa-actions">
      <button id="wa-cancel-change" type="button" class="wa-secondary" hidden>Mantener el número actual</button>
      <button id="wa-submit" type="submit" class="wa-primary">Conectar</button>
    </div>
  </form>
</section>

<style>
  .wa{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid #e4e4e7cc;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 2px #0000000a}
  .wa-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.wa-head h2{margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#18181b}.wa-head p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#71717a}
  .wa-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff7ed;color:#ea580c;font-size:24px}
  .wa-muted{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#71717a}
  .wa-banner,.wa-alert{margin:0;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-radius:12px;background:#fff7ed;color:#9a4914;font-size:13px}
  .wa-banner a{font-weight:700;color:#c2410c;text-decoration:underline}
  .wa-alert{border-color:#fca5a5;background:#fef2f2;color:#991b1b}
  .wa-connected{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:12px;background:#f0fdf4}
  .wa-connected>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-right:auto}
  .wa-label{font-size:12px;color:#4b5563}.wa-number{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#14532d}
  .wa-badge{padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
  .wa-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-radius:12px;background:#fafafa}
  .wa-form label{margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#18181b}
  .wa-form input{padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:#18181b}
  .wa-form input:focus{outline:none;border-color:#f97316;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #f97316}
  .wa-steps{margin:0 0 4px;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;color:#3f3f46;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
  .wa-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
  .wa-primary,.wa-secondary{border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;font:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
  .wa-primary{background:#f97316;color:#fff}.wa-primary:hover{background:#ea580c}
  .wa-secondary{background:#f4f4f5;color:#3f3f46}.wa-secondary:hover{background:#e4e4e7}
  .wa-primary:disabled,.wa-secondary:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
  .wa-primary:focus-visible,.wa-secondary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #fdba74;outline-offset:2px}
  [hidden]{display:none!important}
</style>
